# Measurement results: only reports and scripts are versioned, raw data stays local
/docs/performance_reports/**
!/docs/performance_reports/**/
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.md
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.py
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.sh
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.patch
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.diff
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.cpp
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.h
!/docs/performance_reports/**/*.c
/docs/verification_results/**
